# Usage example 3 — temporal window contrast.
# Authored here, no external rows copied. Domain: project staffing contracts.
#
# Messages: "Was Maria Ionescu a member of the Delta programme on 1 March
# 2025?" and the same question for 1 August 2025. The dates are copied as
# written; the host normalizes them. Inside the validity interval the claim is
# supported; after the exclusive end it is no longer established.
@question query
  where match
    relation "member of project"
    role subject "Maria Ionescu"
    role object "Delta programme"
    polarity affirmed
  end
  at "1 March 2025"

# --- contrast ---
@question query
  where match
    relation "member of project"
    role subject "Maria Ionescu"
    role object "Delta programme"
    polarity affirmed
  end
  at "1 August 2025"
